   "name": "Series Number 1st part Each device has an unambiguous series number, which is either impressed on or glued to the housing. The series number consists of 4 segments, although only parts 1, 2 and 4 are displayed on Modbus. Example: 00839-31324-064-008 1st part: 00839 2nd part: 31324 4th part: 008",
